{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QmgGSymqp8tD1jq3Wnoajh","type":"tool_result","content":"183:- `E.store`: saved data that survives reloads (localStorage, JSON). Never throws.\n184:- `E.store.get(key, fallback = null)`: the value saved under key (any JSON), or fallback\n185:- `E.store.remove(key)`: forget key\n186:- `E.store.set(key, value)`: save value (any JSON) under key; false when storage is blocked\n350:- `input.touchEnabled = true` †: false turns the touch stick off\n653:- `new E.Combo(specs, o = {}) → combo`: new E.Combo(items, { window: .3 }): items are move names, specs or Attacks\n703:- `E.MOVES: slash, backslash, overhead, rising, thrust, spin, plunge, twohand, jab, cross, hook, uppercut, haymaker, elbow, ... (24)`: a library of named attacks with timing and body motion (anticipation, lunge, step, twist, hop). new E.Attack('overhead'), new E.Attack('thrust', { reach: 10 }), new E.Combo(['jab', 'cross', '\n836:- `E.tex.checker(x, y, o = {})`: checkerboard tiles (castle floors, bonus rooms). o: { a, b, size }\n837:- `E.tex.dirt(x, y, o = {})`: dirt, sand or snow: base color with soft noise and specks. o: { base, dark, light }\n838:- `E.tex.flagstone(x, y, pal, size = 16)`: stone flagstones with running-bond rows. pal: {stones:[hex..], mortar, hi, lo, speck}\n839:- `E.tex.grass(x, y, o = {})`: grass with darker tufts and a few flowers. o: { base, dark, light, flower } hex colors\n840:- `E.tex.plain(x, y, o = {})`: plain color with light noise, for roads, carpets and space floors. o: { base, amount }\n841:- `E.tex.planks(x, y, o = {})`: wooden floor boards running along x. o: { base, dark, line }\n842:- `E.tex.water(x, y, o = {})`: water with static ripple lines (baked, so it does not move). o: { base, dark, light }\n\n359:- `E.font.text(g, s, x, y, color = '#ffffff', o = '#0b0814')`: draw text at (x, y) (its top-left; align: 'center' or 'right' moves it) in color. o: an outline color, or { outline, shadow, gradient\n425:- `r.overlay(fn)`: draw fn(g) on top of everything, in screen pixels (HUD, dialog, menus)\n669:- `rig.drawPortrait(g, x, y, size = 40, o = {})` †: a close-up bust for dialog boxes and menus, drawn live from the rig (blinks, hair and hats included): rig.drawPortrait(g, x, y, 40, { zoom: 3, t\n1155:- `E.ui`: pixel-drawn interface pieces for r.overlay\n1157:- `E.ui.box(g, x, y, w, h, o = {})`: window frame: ui.box(g, x, y, w, h, { bg, border, shadow, gradient }) bg: one color (drawn as a soft top-to-bottom gradient, like Final Fantasy windows) or [t\n1159:- `E.ui.hearts(g, x, y, hp, max, o = {})`: row of hearts: hp and max in hearts (halves allowed, e.g. 2.5 of 3)\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium__20261102-191613__xb81546/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"df1bdcb4-3a77-4f4c-afe3-765655b3436d","uuid":"65fd1dd4-ca07-4026-8162-238db4486043","timestamp":"2026-11-03T02:19:34.563Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"183:- `E.store`: saved data that survives reloads (localStorage, JSON). Never throws.\n184:- `E.store.get(key, fallback = null)`: the value saved under key (any JSON), or fallback\n185:- `E.store.remove(key)`: forget key\n186:- `E.store.set(key, value)`: save value (any JSON) under key; false when storage is blocked\n350:- `input.touchEnabled = true` †: false turns the touch stick off\n653:- `new E.Combo(specs, o = {}) → combo`: new E.Combo(items, { window: .3 }): items are move names, specs or Attacks\n703:- `E.MOVES: slash, backslash, overhead, rising, thrust, spin, plunge, twohand, jab, cross, hook, uppercut, haymaker, elbow, ... (24)`: a library of named attacks with timing and body motion (anticipation, lunge, step, twist, hop). new E.Attack('overhead'), new E.Attack('thrust', { reach: 10 }), new E.Combo(['jab', 'cross', '\n836:- `E.tex.checker(x, y, o = {})`: checkerboard tiles (castle floors, bonus rooms). o: { a, b, size }\n837:- `E.tex.dirt(x, y, o = {})`: dirt, sand or snow: bas