{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VAVAmi5Mx2G9ye5WshPKPb","type":"tool_result","content":"418:- `r.decal(fn, o)`: draw on the floor before the queue. opts.emissive (0..1) makes it glow under GPU lighting\n421:- `r.groundDisc(x, y, rad, color, alpha = 1, z = 0)`: a dithered disc lying on the ground (radius in world units, z its height): shadows, auras, area attacks\n423:- `r.groundRing(x, y, rad, color, alpha = 1, z = 0)`: a ring lying on the ground (radius in world units)\n470:- `game.after(seconds, fn)`: run fn once after `seconds` of game time. Cleared on scene change. Returns { cancel() }\n644:- `slash.hits(targets, test, fn)`: during 'active', call fn(target) once per swing for each target where test(target) is true. Returns how many were hit\n658:- `combo.hits(targets, test, fn)`: the current hit's hits(targets, test, fn): fn(target) once per swing where test(target) is true\n1015:- `E.sees(obs, tgt, o = {})`: can observer see target? { seen, d (ground distance), angle (observer -> target), exposure: 0..1 }. The target must be within range and inside the cone fov wide (radians) about the observer's facing; exposure is the share of \n1106:- `new E.Dialog(game, o = {}) → talk`: new E.Dialog(game, { speed, lines, place, color, nameColor, voice, bg, border, vars }): a dialog box that types its text; say() opens it, update(dt) and draw(r) run it\n1134:- `talk.voice = 'text'`: the sound effect each letter blips ('text'; null for silence)\n1580:- `road.hits(z, x, w)`: the scenery a body w half roads wide at (z, x) touches\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium__20261102-191613__xb81546/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"df1bdcb4-3a77-4f4c-afe3-765655b3436d","uuid":"810f4c44-152a-44af-a1ff-ea0d9ba58bea","timestamp":"2026-11-03T02:19:57.842Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"418:- `r.decal(fn, o)`: draw on the floor before the queue. opts.emissive (0..1) makes it 