{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Bq62ueJF6rYyuEenuYttXf","type":"tool_result","content":"200\n/home/micha/.local/bin/viewport-matrix\nusage: viewport-matrix [-h] [-o OUT] [--engines ENGINES] [--all-engines]\n                       [--only ONLY] [--devices DEVICES] [--full-page]\n                       [--dpr1] [--wait WAIT] [--timeout TIMEOUT] [--headed]\n                       url\n\nScreenshot a URL across phone / foldable / tablet / desktop viewports in Chromium, WebKit and Firefox.\n\nWrites one PNG per (device, engine) plus index.html (contact sheet drawn to relative scale) and\nreport.json, and flags horizontal overflow, console errors, page errors and failed requests.\n\nBy default each device runs on the engine it really ships with (iPhone/iPad -> WebKit,\nAndroid -> Chromium) and desktop sizes run on all three engines.\n\n  viewport-matrix http://localhost:5173\n  viewport-matrix http://localhost:5173/play -o /tmp/shots --full-page\n  viewport-matrix URL --engines firefox              # everything in Firefox\n  viewport-matrix URL --all-engines                  # every device x every engine\n  viewport-matrix URL --only phone,foldable --dpr1   # small files, mobile only\n\npositional arguments:\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium__20261102-191613__xb81546/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"df1bdcb4-3a77-4f4c-afe3-765655b3436d","uuid":"1f44d97a-4be6-4daf-87bd-732c33219cde","timestamp":"2026-11-03T02:39:34.000Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"200\n/home/micha/.local/bin/viewport-matrix\nusage: viewport-matrix [-h] [-o OUT] [--engines ENGINES] [--all-engines]\n                       [--only ONLY] [--devices DEVICES] [--full-page]\n                       [--dpr1] [--wait WAIT] [--timeout TIMEOUT] [--headed]\n                       url\n\nScreenshot a URL across phone / foldable / tablet / desktop viewports in Chromium, WebKit and Firefox.\n\nWrites 